{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my Maze, traveler~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game with a 2.5D style and gameplay combining <strong>Survival, Maze Exploration, and Tower Defense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also <strong>Cleverly Set Traps</strong>, combine them with Defense Towers to pull off unexpected combos, and become a trap master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/d1d206bea6088828dc7c25255c6a2286.poster.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/d1d206bea6088828dc7c25255c6a2286.webm?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/d1d206bea6088828dc7c25255c6a2286.mp4?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There's also a Free and Flexible combat system</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can craft powerful Weapons and engage in close combat with monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also scatter garbage all over the ground, and use your agility and positioning to make monsters trip over the garbage and get hurt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also put on a mask, disguise yourself as one of the monsters' accomplices, and escape their pursuit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also start a fire to burn the monsters...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even rally a group of monsters to attack another group of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you can think of it!</p></li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/24087a07f17311a5da82a0b5ae2aad8a.poster.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/24087a07f17311a5da82a0b5ae2aad8a.webm?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/24087a07f17311a5da82a0b5ae2aad8a.mp4?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Maze, you may encounter several distinct, Fairy-Tale-Like Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kingdoms in this Fairy-Tale World, such as the Poker Card Kingdom, the Baboon Kingdom, the Steam Kingdom, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conflicts persist among the various kingdoms, and the entire world is already on the brink of collapse...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your survival days increase, you may travel to every kingdom and uncover the secrets hidden in every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/eb4ceca12931f12b6b61a33defcaf898.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>During the day, you need to enter the Maze to collect supplies necessary for survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ores, branches, and parts\u2014they are the flesh and blood of the Maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, Merchants, and mysterious BOSSes await your challenge in the Maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/e5ea564dd0d7ccaccc58db7de5794b59.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>At night, you must return to the Main Base and protect the Core Crystal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the Maze is unpredictable, and terrifying monsters will also appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect the Core Crystal from being destroyed, you can build Weapons or Defense Towers to fend off the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, I highly recommend building some Traps! When Traps and Defense Towers work together, they can form combos, pin down monsters, and <strong>Deal Higher Damage!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/aadec42a3c5289f8993271383193d18b.poster.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/aadec42a3c5289f8993271383193d18b.webm?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/aadec42a3c5289f8993271383193d18b.mp4?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abundant BOSSes and Residents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different kingdoms have different residents\u2014such as the Poker Card King, Steam Soldiers, Ferocious Monsters, and so on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of the Maze are not always hostile. Communicate with them and <strong>Give Them Items Generously</strong>\u2014perhaps... you can become Friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/7a2e15b61ce35e795a57b745014bc1ac.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/b4fed3b58f92e0950dfe4cae5d689a6b.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/a841cca6703020e95b0ba98251507e1e.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/5d4d7118b69380af85aed49194c0b000.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865300?t=1771659964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2865300?t=1771659964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/58dc19c61c8e6ede8db1149b83026731086b334f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771659964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/58dc19c61c8e6ede8db1149b83026731086b334f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771659964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to my Maze, traveler~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game with a 2.5D style and gameplay combining <strong>Survival, Maze Exploration, and Tower Defense.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also <strong>Cleverly Set Traps</strong>, combine them with Defense Towers to pull off unexpected combos, and become a trap master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/d1d206bea6088828dc7c25255c6a2286.poster.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1170 h