 are many kingdoms in this Fairy-Tale World, such as the Poker Card Kingdom, the Baboon Kingdom, the Steam Kingdom, and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conflicts persist among the various kingdoms, and the entire world is already on the brink of collapse...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your survival days increase, you may travel to every kingdom and uncover the secrets hidden in every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/eb4ceca12931f12b6b61a33defcaf898.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>During the day, you need to enter the Maze to collect supplies necessary for survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ores, branches, and parts\u2014they are the flesh and blood of the Maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters, Merchants, and mysterious BOSSes await your challenge in the Maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/e5ea564dd0d7ccaccc58db7de5794b59.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>At night, you must return to the Main Base and protect the Core Crystal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, the Maze is unpredictable, and terrifying monsters will also appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To protect the Core Crystal from being destroyed, you can build Weapons or Defense Towers to fend off the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, I highly recommend building some Traps! When Traps and Defense Towers work together, they can form combos, pin down monsters, and <strong>Deal Higher Damage!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/aadec42a3c5289f8993271383193d18b.poster.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/aadec42a3c5289f8993271383193d18b.webm?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/aadec42a3c5289f8993271383193d18b.mp4?t=1771659964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abundant BOSSes and Residents</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different kingdoms have different residents\u2014such as the Poker Card King, Steam Soldiers, Ferocious Monsters, and so on...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The residents of the Maze are not always hostile. Communicate with them and <strong>Give Them Items Generously</strong>\u2014perhaps... you can become Friends?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/7a2e15b61ce35e795a57b745014bc1ac.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/b4fed3b58f92e0950dfe4cae5d689a6b.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/a841cca6703020e95b0ba98251507e1e.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865300/extras/5d4d7118b69380af85aed49194c0b000.avif?t=1771659964\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></ul>","developers":["HJ Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":